    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663720/extras/227773c2df856a64f38d5d63b6860a55.poster.avif?t=1700004931\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663720/extras/227773c2df856a64f38d5d63b6860a55.webm?t=1700004931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663720/extras/227773c2df856a64f38d5d63b6860a55.mp4?t=1700004931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>FORSISTED is a psychological horror game that tells the story of a criminal from the past who has to face the terrible curse of his deeds in a haunted mansion. Get ready for a dark adventure full of remorse and lurking ghosts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2>In the crime-ridden town of Ravenwood, notorious outlaw Vinn Xander's reign of terror comes to an end when he is finally caught during a botched heist. Sentenced to the dreaded Ravenwood Penitentiary, he is given a chance at redemption by detective Jack Neil, who recruits him to investigate a long-cursed mansion. With a unique communication tool, Vinn must navigate the secrets of the eerie mansion and face evil spirits as he uncovers the dark history and tries to break the prison's curse. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663720/extras/26a2b9be47a776761f1470a54d58eec9.poster.avif?t=1700004931\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663720/extras/26a2b9be47a776761f1470a54d58eec9.webm?t=1700004931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663720/extras/26a2b9be47a776761f1470a54d58eec9.mp4?t=1700004931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realistic graphics</li></ul>Realistic graphics, enveloping players in a chilling nightmare. The dynamic lighting system casts eerie, shifting shadows that play tricks on the player's senses, with pitch-black corners where unseen terrors may lurk and realistic volumetric fog that obscures vision just enough to create suspense and anticipation.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>immersive sound design</li></ul>Sound design seamlessly integrates with the graphics, further intensifying the horror experience. Realistic audio cues accompany terrifying visuals, such as echoing footsteps, distant whispers, and bone-chilling cries, immersing players in an auditory nightmare.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple Endings</li></ul>Your choices in this haunting narrative will plunge you deeper into the abyss. With different and horrifying endings, each playthrough will lead you into a new madness, ensuring no two nightmares are the same.<br><br><strong><u>Game genre: Horror, Walking simulator.</u><br><u>Average time to complete the game: 170min</u></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663720/extras/227773c2df856a64f38d5d63b6860a55.poster.avif?t=1700004931\" width=600 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663720/extras/227773c2df856a64f38d5d63b6860a55.webm?t=1700004931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663720/extras/227773c2df856a64f38d5d63b6860a55.mp4?t=1700004931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>FORSISTED is a psychological horror game that tells the story of a criminal from the past who has to face the terrible curse of his deeds in a haunted mansion. Get ready for a dark adventure full of remorse and lurking ghosts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2>In the crime-ridden town of Ravenwood, notorious outlaw Vinn Xander's reign of terror comes to an end when he is finally caught during a botched heist. Sentenced to the dreaded Ravenwood Penitentiary, he is given a chance at redemption by detective Jack Neil, who recruits him to investigate a long-cursed mansion. With a unique communication tool, Vinn must navigate the secrets of the eerie mansion and face evil spirits as he uncovers the dark history and tries to break the prison's curse. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663720/extras/26a2b9be47a776761f1470a54d58eec9.poster.avif?t=1700004931\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663720/extras/26a2b9be47a776761f1470a54d58eec9.webm?t=1700004931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663720/extras/26a2b9be47a776761f1470a54d58eec9.mp4?t=1700004931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realistic graphics</li></ul>Realistic graphics, enveloping players in a chilling nightmare. The dynamic lighting system casts eerie, shifting shadows that play tricks on the player's senses, with pitch-black corners where unseen terrors may lurk and realistic volumetric fog that obscures vision just enough to create suspense and anticipation.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>immersive sound design</li></ul>Sound design seamlessly integrates with the graphics, further intensifying the horror experience. Realistic audio cues accompany terrifying visuals, such as echoing footsteps, distant whispers, and bone-chilling cries, immersing players in an auditory nightmare.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple Endings</li></ul>Your choices in this haunting narrative will plunge you deeper into the abyss. With different and horrifying endings, each playthrough will lead you into a new madness, ensuring no two nightmares are the same.<br><br><strong><u>Game genre: Horror, Walking simulator.</u><br><u>Average time to complete the game: 170min</u></strong>",
